Hi, I’m Fiza, a data scientist and ML engineer working on European power markets and trading analytics. My current research with A2A Energia focuses on electricity-price forecasting, residual-load forecast revisions and leakage-free backtesting of trading signals, built in Python (Pandas, Scikit-learn, Dash/Plotly).

Earlier ML work includes stock market prediction, deepfake audio detection, deepfake video classification, data scraping and prompt-based NLP tasks. I enjoy turning complex, messy problems into reproducible models that people can use to make decisions.
